  "worked_example": "AVS 2.32.3 ~ AVS 5.23.10 differ in exactly '3' -> '10'",
  "this_is_the_campaign_pattern": "an apparent difference that is our own modelling. corpus-audit.md already records that text_original keeps '||18||' and '{11}' inline by design; I read that and still let the numeral drive a claim.",
